==== Wave 1: Modlist

Wave 1 keeps Wave 0's quality-of-life base (the foundational toolset) and begins adding *content and mechanics* — but no pure power spikes. The rule for this wave: anything that adds capability must also add something to learn or manage.

As of this release, the wave-specific cards below are *pending addition* — per project decision, mods come from you, not from this project. When you add them, use one card per mod with the fields this guide's rules demand; anything you do not supply stays *"user to provide"*.

The wave's centerpiece aircraft is the *Cirrus SR22* (stock X-Plane 12 aircraft — no card needed; confirm it is present in your install's aircraft menu).

